constraints:
4 ≤ N ≤ 10^{4}

expected time complexity: O(N*log(logN))
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def primeDivision(self, N):

		def check_prime(n):
			for i in range(2, int(n ** 0.5) + 1):
				if n % i == 0:
					return False
			return True
		for i in range(N - 2, 1, -1):
			if check_prime(i) and check_prime(N - i):
				return (N - i, i)
				break
